Venus Patches NOTICE
====================

Some features are based on ideas from community Discord plugins. The code is written for this
project: it hooks Discord's own pinned 350.8 JavaScript bundle and doesn't include or load
code from any other client mod.

PlatformIndicators uses five device icons from Martinz64/vendetta-plugins, which are released
under The Unlicense. Release 1.3.9 briefly replaced them with Venus-drawn glyphs; 1.4.0 (first published as 1.3.10)
brings the original icons back.

ReviewDB talks to the community ReviewDB service (manti.vendicated.dev) only when you turn it
on. Venus Patches isn't affiliated with or endorsed by that service, or by Discord Inc.
Discord is a trademark of Discord Inc.

Quest Completer is based on the approach of community quest scripts: aamiaa's "Complete Recent
Discord Quest" gist, nicola02nb's CompleteDiscordQuest and Equicord's Questify (all GPL-3.0). Its
code is written for this project against Discord 350.8's own modules.

patches/src/main/kotlin/util/PatchListGenerator.kt is adapted from the Morphe patches
template (https://github.com/MorpheApp/morphe-patches-template) and keeps its header.

ValidUser is based on the ValidUser Revenge plugin by fshin, o.oer and kmmiio99o
(fshinz/Revenge-Plugins). Split Large Messages is based on the SplitLargeMessages Vendetta plugin by
sunnie (sunnniee/vendetta-plugins). Double-tap to reply is based on Geastures+ by kmmiio99o
(https://rksv.kmmiio99o.dev/GeasturesPlus). All three are rewritten for this project against Discord 350.8's modules.

Translate messages uses Google Translate's public web endpoint (translate.googleapis.com) at the user's
request. No Google code is included; translations are Google's.

Server info is based on the idea of fshin's ServerInfo Revenge plugin (fshinz/Revenge-Plugins). Its code
is written for this project against Discord 350.8's own stores and server menu.

Icon packs is based on the idea and community icon pack catalog of nexpid's Themes+ plugin
(nexpid/ThemesPlus), with icon packs created by Rosie, Rairof, Lemon, Jay, Google, Hurricane,
480 Design, WalkQuackBack, doraa and Iconsax. Its code is written for this project against
Discord 350.8's own AssetRegistry and BaseIconImage modules.

Custom branding renames the package, its permission and its providers the same way Morphe's
"Clone app" patch does. Its code is written for this project against Discord 350.8's manifest.

Bring back Tenor GIFs is based on the idea of Livie's BringBackTenor Vendetta plugin (lvwmwm/vendettian-plugins). Its
code is written for this project against Discord 350.8's own GIF picker. It asks Tenor's public v1 API
(g.tenor.com) for GIFs only while it's on. Venus Patches isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Tenor or Google.
